      "id": "gamelift-001",
      "category": "new-passrole",
      "predicted": "PG-IAM-004",
      "observed": "accepted",
      "note": "A MISS. The instance role of a GameLift fleet trusts ec2.amazonaws.com, but the table maps gamelift:CreateFleet to gamelift.amazonaws.com. ProofGate requires the trusted service to equal the PassedToService value, so the path is not seen. The same gap exists for any service that passes an EC2 instance role (EMR, Image Builder, GameLift). Candidate fix for a later spec: when the launch service passes an instance profile, also count trust of ec2.amazonaws.com."
